    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victim Complex: Part 1 is a Demo for the upcoming full game release, scheduled for Q4 2025. Add to your library for updates on progress of the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victim Complex is a first person, narrative-driven horror experience. Play as hack medium Jack Lognare, who has stumbled on his first legitimate haunting. Will you try to help the spirits trapped in the haunted apartment complex, or will you rush to save yourself before whatever killed them gets you too?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Iconic Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use iconic ghost-hunting equipment to find and communicate with the lingering spirits in an abandoned apartment complex. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/f6b71fd87a8918f61f9167142514f883.poster.avif?t=1738782540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/f6b71fd87a8918f61f9167142514f883.webm?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/f6b71fd87a8918f61f9167142514f883.mp4?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/23d10cbdfd7e233b3f098ce3a4deb3bb.poster.avif?t=1738782540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/23d10cbdfd7e233b3f098ce3a4deb3bb.webm?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/23d10cbdfd7e233b3f098ce3a4deb3bb.mp4?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the spirits' clues to discover what happened to the deceased tenants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/0d41602135658e66c9300b1d09430afe.poster.avif?t=1738782540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/0d41602135658e66c9300b1d09430afe.webm?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/0d41602135658e66c9300b1d09430afe.mp4?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever killed the tenants is still here... can you avoid it and escape with your life? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/2e573a2094599c017b5877f2ffe95c0b.poster.avif?t=1738782540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/2e573a2094599c017b5877f2ffe95c0b.webm?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/2e573a2094599c017b5877f2ffe95c0b.mp4?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack medium Jack Lognare has a specialty: &quot;cleansing&quot; haunted locations so that they can be fixed up and sold without the stigma they once had in their communities. When he is hired to exorcise the spirits in an apartment complex in rural Wisconsin, he expects to find the same thing he usually does: nothing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he arrives, he discovers that this time, the rumors may actually be true, and he has found his first legitimate haunting. Initially thrilled to use his phony &quot;ghost hunting equipment&quot; for real, he soon learns that the malicious Entity that supposedly killed all the residents may be real as well... and it doesn't plan on letting him leave so easily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter will have multiple endings; will Jack help the trapped spirits along the way and get the true answers, or focus on getting out as quickly as possible before he shares their fate? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide how Jack will fare, in Victim Complex. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victim Complex: Part 1 is a Demo for the upcoming full game release, scheduled for Q4 2025. Add to your library for updates on progress of the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victim Complex is a first person, narrative-driven horror experience. Play as hack medium Jack Lognare, who has stumbled on his first legitimate haunting. Will you try to help the spirits trapped in the haunted apartment complex, or will you rush to save yourself before whatever killed them gets you too?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Iconic Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use iconic ghost-hunting equipment to find and communicate with the lingering spirits in an abandoned apartment complex. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/f6b71fd87a8918f61f9167142514f883.poster.avif?t=1738782540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/f6b71fd87a8918f61f9167142514f883.webm?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/f6b71fd87a8918f61f9167142514f883.mp4?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/23d10cbdfd7e233b3f098ce3a4deb3bb.poster.avif?t=1738782540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/23d10cbdfd7e233b3f098ce3a4deb3bb.webm?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/23d10cbdfd7e233b3f098ce3a4deb3bb.mp4?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the spirits' clues to discover what happened to the deceased tenants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/0d41602135658e66c9300b1d09430afe.poster.avif?t=1738782540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/0d41602135658e66c9300b1d09430afe.webm?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/0d41602135658e66c9300b1d09430afe.mp4?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay Alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever killed the tenants is still here... can you avoid it and escape with your life? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/2e573a2094599c017b5877f2ffe95c0b.poster.avif?t=1738782540\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/2e573a2094599c017b5877f2ffe95c0b.webm?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840800/extras/2e573a2094599c017b5877f2ffe95c0b.mp4?t=1738782540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack medium Jack Lognare has a specialty: &quot;cleansing&quot; haunted locations so that they can be fixed up and sold without the stigma they once had in their communities. When he is hired to exorcise the spirits in an apartment complex in rural Wisconsin, he expects to find the same thing he usually does: nothing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he arrives, he discovers that this time, the rumors may actually be true, and he has found his first legitimate haunting. Initially thrilled to use his phony &quot;ghost hunting equipment&quot; for real, he soon learns that the malicious Entity that supposedly killed all the residents may be real as well... and it doesn't plan on letting him leave so easily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter will have multiple endings; will Jack help the trapped spirits along the way and get the true answers, or focus on getting out as quickly as possible before he shares their fate? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide how Jack will fare, in Victim Complex. </p>",
